PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Eigenvalue Axis
    - Horizontal axis from λ0 to λ5
    - Tick marks every 200px
  L2: Eigenvalue Markers
    - λ0 at left (white circle)
    - λ1 at next position (white circle)
    - λ2–λ5 as additional circles
  L3: Spectral Gap Highlight
    - Bracket between λ0 and λ1
    - Label: "γ = λ1"
    - Bracket in bright blue (#00A0FFFF)
  L4: Labels
    - "Eigenvalues of Δ"
    - λ0, λ1, λ2, etc.

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
